Design lineage
===============================================================================

TheRobotStudio - SO-ARM100 / SO-ARM101
    https://github.com/TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100
    Licensed under Apache-2.0.

    SO-ARM 102 keeps the joint layout of SO-ARM101 so that it stays compatible
    with LeRobot. All parts in models/ are new Robonine designs. No upstream
    geometry files are redistributed here.

Robonine - SO-ARM100/101 Parallel Gripper
    https://github.com/roboninecom/SO-ARM100-101-Parallel-Gripper

    The follower gripper (RB9.01.062.* parts) is a revision of this gripper.


